  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Localization
  Japanese: 
  English: 'Gem effects vary depending on the type.

    Damage-dealing gems, such
    as the "Ruby," allow you to attack enemies.

    Shield-gaining gems, such as
    the "Sapphire," allow you to defend against enemy attacks.


    You can check
    gem effects in the slot at the top left.'
  ReloadOn: 0
