  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Localization
  Japanese: 
  English: 'During the transition phase following a battle,

    you can restore
    HP and purchase equipment.


    Selecting "Rest" will fully restore your HP.

    If
    your HP is already sufficient, it is a good idea to select "Train"

    to increase
    your maximum HP.'
