  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Localization
  Japanese: 
  English: 'Cast gems to defeat enemies.

    Select a square on the board and "Hand"
    it to cast gems.

    When you "Hand" a gem, all adjacent gems of the same type
    are cast along with it.


    Casting a large number of gems at once yields a
    greater effect.'
  ReloadOn: 0
